@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title US023 - To get the list of items on direct sale of a given publication

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : I want to get the list of items on direct sale of a given publication
Buyer <-- System : Which publication? Choose!
Buyer -> System : publication
System --> Buyer : Shows the list of items on direct sale

@enduml